# A 0xE5 status record: bus error / error passive.
# Captured from a USBCAN-2E-U on endpoint 0x85 while the adapter was the only
# node on the bus, so nothing acknowledged its transmissions. A steady stream of
# these is the signature of that condition.
0f e5 03 00 86 fe c1 02 a2 01 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
